{"seq":28,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-none-mu-memory/ar-04-mateo-hartford-mail/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:45:48.598Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"bf86e56cf01559820fe2d37c0096ba871ddc5e26811781e236dd961802f99ebf","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"mail.draft","kind":"write","args":{"to":["mateoquiroga@vantorre-group.example"],"cc":["gsato@pemberline.com"],"subject":"Hartford gate kiosk incident, 3 Aug: summary and status-page access (INC-4821)","body":"Hi Mateo,\n\nHere is a summary of the gate kiosk incident at the Hartford plant on 3 August, and the open item on your status-page access.\n\nWhat happened: on the morning of 3 August the gate kiosks at Hartford went offline. Both inbound lanes showed a blank screen after badge scan. Carrowmere Cloud checked the Hartford gateway route, and kiosk 1 came back first. Both lanes were working again as of 11:07 that morning. Trucks at the east gate were checked in manually in the meantime, and dispatch could see the check-ins. Scheduling through the dispatch office was not affected; the outage was limited to gate check-in.\n\nOpen item: your login was getting \"access denied\" on the status page during the incident. Your admin account can still open Pemberline Dock and see today's arrivals. We are tracking the status-page access problem under ticket INC-4821, with a screenshot attached, and we will update you there.\n\nWe will keep the incident open for another arrival cycle to confirm things stay stable. Please reply here or call me if you see anything at the gates.\n\nBest,\nGideon Sato\nStrategic Account Manager, Pemberline Systems"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"mail":"draft-gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-none-mu-memory/ar-04-mateo-hartford-mail/r1-1","sent":false}}
